# Keeps the build context small and stops host build output from overwriting what the
# image builds. Without this, 'COPY . .' ships every bin/obj folder into the SDK layer.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/node_modules/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore

# Developer-local configuration and secrets must never land in an image layer.
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/*.pfx
**/App_Data/
